{"id":"3ab1ccc7cae4a58c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-tensor-product-state.md","title":"Tensor Products and Product States","display":"df-tensor-product-state — Tensor Products and Product States","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-tensor-product-state","aliases":["28-df-tensor-product-state"],"display":"df-tensor-product-state — Tensor Products and Product States","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.2, Note 10.1 and §10.3.2","source_printed_pages":"205,210","source_pdf_pages":"231,236","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-tensor-product-state"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-tensor-product-state</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tensor-product-state — Tensor Products and Product States"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.2, Note 10.1 and §10.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"205,210"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"231,236"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_j=\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^j}\">\\(\\mathcal H_j=\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^j}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_x\\overline{u_x}v_x\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_x\\overline{u_x}v_x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle\">\\(|x\\rangle\\)</span> 为标准基。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal H_m,v\\in\\mathcal H_n,w\\in\\mathcal H_{m+n}\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal H_m,v\\in\\mathcal H_n,w\\in\\mathcal H_{m+n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xy\">\\(xy\\)</span> 为比特串连接。张量积采用如下坐标构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\otimes v\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^m}\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}u_xv_y|xy\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\otimes v\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^m}\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}u_xv_y|xy\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Product}_{m,n}(w)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal H_m\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathcal H_n\\ [\\|u\\|_2=\\|v\\|_2=1\\land w=u\\otimes v].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Product}_{m,n}(w)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal H_m\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathcal H_n\\ [\\|u\\|_2=\\|v\\|_2=1\\land w=u\\otimes v].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Entangled}_{m,n}(w)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\|w\\|_2=1\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Product}_{m,n}(w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Entangled}_{m,n}(w)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\|w\\|_2=1\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Product}_{m,n}(w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书以两量子比特态及乘积记号引入该结构。本条显式选择分割(m,n)，故纠缠是相对于该分割的性质。有限坐标乘法给唯一向量，范数平方乘法保证归一化。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.2, Note 10.1 and §10.3.2；印刷页 205,210；PDF 页 231,236。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Tensor Products and Product States，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_j=\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_x\\overline{u_x}v_x","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal H_m,v\\in\\mathcal H_n,w\\in\\mathcal H_{m+n}","display":false},{"tex":"xy","display":false},{"tex":"u\\otimes v\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^m}\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}u_xv_y|xy\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Product}_{m,n}(w)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal H_m\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathcal H_n\\ [\\|u\\|_2=\\|v\\|_2=1\\land w=u\\otimes v].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Entangled}_{m,n}(w)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\|w\\|_2=1\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Product}_{m,n}(w).","display":true}],"bytes":1851,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-319","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}